<title>GERMANY: Rheinmetall says to restructure.</title>
<headline>Rheinmetall says to restructure.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German armaments maker Rheinmetall AG said it would restructure at the turn of the year.</p>
<p>It gave no further details, but said it would hold a news conference on December 16.</p>
<p>Last week, Rheinmetall said it was part of a group with British Aerospace Plc and Badenwerk AG that acquired former Bremer Vulkan unit STN Atlas Elektronik.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
